## How this essay was made

A revision-branch experiment. An initial D0 manuscript was preserved, and separate branches explored one and three critique–revision cycles. A selector compared the resulting alternatives and preserved the chosen version. The zero-cycle starting point remained available.

Campaign: `hundred-20260925` · Lineage: `branching-01`. The midterm ID is a blinded corpus label, not a rank.

Recorded model observations: `claude-opus-5-5`, `claude-opus-5-5 / high`, `gpt-6-astra`, `gpt-6-astra / high`, `gpt-6-astra / ultra`, `gpt-6-luna`, `gpt-6-luna / xhigh`. These identify recorded configurations, not independent backend attestation.

